oblique        100        2.23e-12        2.31e-14  PASS

[2] Planted degenerate cases (exact):
  n=0 empty              trace=0      rank=0   PASS
  A = 0 (4x4)            trace=0      rank=0   PASS
  A = I (5x5)            trace=5      rank=5   PASS
  A = [[1,1],[0,0]]      trace=1      rank=1   PASS
  A = [[0,1],[0,1]]      trace=1      rank=1   PASS

