  methods: Newton iteration (3X^2-2X^3) + eigendecomposition with adversarial thresholds in [0.2, 0.8]
  max |tr - rank| over hunt: 1.95e-12
  no candidate counterexamples  PASS

========================================================================
MAX |tr - rank| OVER ALL INSTANCES: 1.954e-12
VERDICT: SUPPORTIVE of tr = rank (over R)
CAVEAT: probe is over R only; over F_p the identity holds only mod p (e.g. I_p over F_p has rank p, trace 0).
